    "excerpt": "The weather over the last 7-10 days has been nothing short of spectacular across the mid-Atlantic States, and the gorgeous conditions will stick around through Halloween and perhaps even the first 2-3 days of November. Behind Monday night's weak cold frontal passage, light, northeasterly winds of 5-10 mph will usher slightly cooler air into the Commonwealth today. …",
